  "releaseNotes": "v 10.2.2\nDOCUMENTATION\n- The README told you to call app.UseSpaXsrf(), which does not exist. The method is\napp.UseAntiforgeryGenerator().\n- The README claimed support for custom header and cookie names. The cookie name is XSRF-TOKEN and\nis not configurable; the header name is set through the standard services.AddAntiforgery(...)\noptions, not by this package.",
